ƒgascribeƒgproduct‚dbasefEntityƒgproduct‚fvectorƒgproduct‚dbasefEntityƒgproductƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunitdmark‚fvectorƒhgrounded‚dbasefEntity‚dbasefEntityƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;zXVqm_EqR4YJII4hBaAjJ4AZrWLs_DjOLU9KqRATbbUƒdpairƒfvectorƒgproduct‚dbasefEntityƒgproductƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunitdmark˜gƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;zXVqm_EqR4YJII4hBaAjJ4AZrWLs_DjOLU9KqRATbbUƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;3Mo0vV8XqUCcINW_-WO1oTuqAm90eFfYVnMo_j84lDQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxDni:///sha-256;ebrZ90_nZRpBkxaSQgcdu4hUd_ReVnu8YtU7CQ9QhXg.admissionsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;8LW1EgehO8ZlM_XpXfHXvgXryRs3Vx7SmQ2u-WPoBVoƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;3VIDPbXONzQMTWIFkHBMe48s6xVk8Ka4rq7rg5bODaoƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;uectTHTX10pwqiNTFjXO2OJ6KpBAiAu9yK-zvgN0icYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;glx_Qxr34ETP0Xst9v0_V7HpZBk-jjh4oNoRq_-99YUƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;HT1HFymPl0TxsW5T2uhhvNsWA5xMZvTub7Pb4JOxbYUƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;T99ackBoVtR6rBC4NSOr4z1BXARpxLylR_jC1vNhfhkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstard